  m_text: "If you find yourself there\u2014in those rooms, in those memories\u2014be
    careful.\nSome things I specifically tried to forget.\nI no longer know where
    I end and where everything else begins.\nBut if you can piece it all back together...
    maybe you\u2019ll find me.\nOr you\u2019ll understand why I disappeared.\n\nBecause
    I no longer know <size=200%>WHICH OF THEM IS TELLING THE TRUTH.</size>"
